e Black Flower Cult, a murderous group that uses sorcery. In response, Wei has her executed, causing their only son, Fang Tu, to leave their clan. Wei divides the mask and entrusts half to a Shaolin monk, Master Kai, while keeping the other half himself. Fang Tu kills his father and takes his half. Kai requests that the player transport the other half to a secret sanctuary. The player is assisted by an ally, Wu Ching.", "summary": "Enhanced port with improved visuals of Supreme Warrior for the Sega CD 32X.\nA Sega Saturn version was also planned for release in March 1996, but was later cancelled.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/supreme-warrior--1", "videos": [{"id": 113985, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "NzQiGC5hucE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NzQiGC5hucE", "title": "Supreme Warrior Mega-CD 32X", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NzQiGC5hucE/sddefault.jpg"}]}